 "excerpts": [
  {
   "beat_id": "B02",
   "start_line": 8,
   "end_line": 8,
   "text": "- No human has signed off any section, and nobody has playtested the game by hand."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B03",
   "start_line": 37,
   "end_line": 37,
   "text": "**PROPOSED vision statement:** *Fly a lone wisp up three ruined streets, thin out a monster army that keeps marching, and win the city back from the Cerberus at its gate.*"
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B05",
   "start_line": 61,
   "end_line": 62,
   "text": "| PX-01 | A first-time player clears stage 1 on the first or second try | Observe 5 new players |\n| PX-02 | Stage 2 feels like a step up, not a wall | Compare lives lost per stage over 10 runs |"
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B06",
   "start_line": 70,
   "end_line": 70,
   "text": "- **IMPLEMENTED** (`player.gd`): 5 units/s, where one Unity unit is 72 px (orthographic size 5 on a 720 px view), so 360 px/s. Clamped to the 640 px playfield, not the whole screen. Holding `Shift` (AUTHORED) halves the speed and shows a dot over the 13 px hitbox."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B08",
   "start_line": 96,
   "end_line": 96,
   "text": "- The per-monster values are AUTHORED. Unity's per-prefab values lived in prefabs that were not delivered, apart from the script defaults (3 HP, 100 points, speed −1 = 72 px/s)."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B10",
   "start_line": 100,
   "end_line": 100,
   "text": "- Unity ended the game on the first touch (`gameOverScreen.SetActive(true); Time.timeScale = 0`)."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B13",
   "start_line": 112,
   "end_line": 112,
   "text": "- **SOURCE:** `GameManager.cs` loads FinishStageOne when `score >= goalScore` in stage 0, otherwise ClearTheGame. `goalScore` is an inspector value, and the scenes were not delivered, so **the 2000 and 4000 goals are AUTHORED**."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B14",
   "start_line": 116,
   "end_line": 116,
   "text": "- 110 HP and worth 5000 points. It walks in from the top over 2.6 s, shielded: shots are absorbed."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B16",
   "start_line": 126,
   "end_line": 126,
   "text": "  - Unity's `RestartGame()` always loaded StageOne."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B18",
   "start_line": 138,
   "end_line": 138,
   "text": "- **Scrolling street:** the stage painting scrolls down at 70, 95 or 45 px/s. It alternates with a vertically mirrored copy, so the seam always matches."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B19",
   "start_line": 170,
   "end_line": 170,
   "text": "- All 7 scenes are thin; their nodes are built in code. The three stage scenes are seven lines each and set only `stage_id` on `game.gd`."
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B20",
   "start_line": 181,
   "end_line": 181,
   "text": "| R-04 | The code comment and README say monsters spawn within ±4.5 Unity units; the code uses ±288 px, which is 4 units. |"
  }
 ],
